  "description": "Mino’s just like any other cat on the streets, except he’s got a secret… He’s actually a rare musk cat, and on top of that, he’s an omega. Mino hides his heats with as much suppressants he can get his paws on. If anyone found out his secret and just how much he’s worth, he could get in some serious trouble. But one day, a mysterious cat named Yiho prances into his life. Yiho’s so handsome and he smells better than any other cat Mino’s met, but he’s also got so much to hide… \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
